<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Staveley raised at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Staveley raised at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staveley Industries Plc was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sources said BZW highlighted the high yield on the stock and the cash generative qualities of Staveley's UK salt business.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2p at 168-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
